  "semantic": {
    "lines": [
      "Hm...you don't have wing items.",
      "Then you cannot use the power of teleport.",
      "Well...you have no idea what teleport and ",
      "wing items are?",
      "You will be able to find a teleport spot ",
      "in every area in Priston land.",
      "You may teleport yourself to another place ",
      "through the warp gate. However, you must have ",
      "a wing item to use this convenient feature.",
      "A wing item is made of combining monster ",
      "crystals. I can make you one if you bring me ",
      "those crystals.",
      "Bring me a hoppie crystal, hob goblin crystal, ",
      "and 3000 gold, then I will give you a metal ",
      "wing. What do you say? Wanna try?"
    ]
  },
